      "reasons": [
        "The packet does not support the general definition that “a dimension is one distinct aspect within a larger, multidimensional psychological experience.” It only describes that evaluative threat (ET) may “form an internal dimension of” music performance anxiety (MPA).",
        "The definition’s specific example (“such as evaluative threat alongside other related aspects”) is broadly consistent with the packet naming ET alongside anticipatory tension and error monitoring (ATEM) and anxiety-related performance impairment (ARPI), but the broader, cross-cutting characterization of the term is not directly supported."
